s at time 1\n    for v in starts:\n        add_edge(s, (v - 1) * 100 + 1, 1, 0)\n\n    # staying edges for each city\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        for j in range(1, 100):\n            add_edge((i - 1) * 100 + j, (i - 1) * 100 + j + 1, 100, c)\n\n    # moving edges for each road\n    for _ in range(m):\n        u = data[ptr]; v = data[ptr+1]; ptr += 2\n        for j in range(1, 100):\n            idx = (u - 1) * 100 + j\n            idy = (v - 1) * 100 + j + 1\n            for p in range(1, 21):\n                cost = c + (p * p - (p - 1) * (p - 1)) * d\n                add_edge(idx, idy, 1, cost)\n            idx2 = (v - 1) * 100 + j\n            idy2 = (u - 1) * 100 + j + 1\n            for p in range(1, 21):\n                cost = c + (p * p - (p - 1) * (p - 1)) * d\n                add_edge(idx2, idy2, 1, cost)\n\n    print(min_cost_max_flow(s, t))\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-6.067568756407127e-05, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.00026842328952625394, -6.90197994117625e-05, 0.0, -5.006777428206988e-06, -3.814689989667386e-06, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.00011050090688513592, -0.2014637142419815, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1086402082582936e-05, -0.00021169328829273582, -0.16022491455078125, -0.0001426833332516253, -0.00012087091454304755, -0.004491954110562801, -0.5856460332870483, -7.760223525110632e-05, -0.0032599421683698893, -0.0015028145862743258, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.03884280472993851, -6.198863957251888e-06, -0.0005534547381103039, -0.03805048018693924, -5.245195097813848e-06, -0.3999095857143402, -0.0019338493002578616, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -2.622600959512056e-06, -2.3841830625315197e-06, -0.006489986553788185, -0.06196795031428337, 0.0, -0.00013267113536130637, -1.823885577323381e-05, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -3.814689989667386e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07,